<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Terra Nitrogen upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Terra Nitrogen upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney has upgraded Terra Nitrogen Co LP to outperform from neutral, a source at the brokerage said Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Sioux City, Iowa, nitrogen fertilizer company closed at 40-1/8 Monday.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street Desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
